      "x": -375, "y": -422,
      "width": 210, "height": 134,
      "text": "S1 · GLOBAL-PERM  (GATE)\npermute phi uniformly across\nall bins genome-wide\ndestroys: sequence<->structure\ncorrespondence AND autocorrelation\nPRIMARY RELIANCE PROBE",
      "originalText": "S1 · GLOBAL-PERM  (GATE)\npermute phi uniformly across\nall bins genome-wide\ndestroys: sequence<->structure\ncorrespondence AND autocorrelation\nPRIMARY RELIANCE PROBE",
