      "x": -75, "y": -422,
      "width": 210, "height": 134,
      "text": "S2 · CIRCULAR-SHIFT\nroll phi ~10 Mb per chr\ndestroys: sequence alignment\npreserves: marginals AND local\nautocorrelation\nrules out: any smooth slowly-\nvarying auxiliary channel helps",
