      "width": 210, "height": 134,
      "text": "S3 · DISTANCE-MATCHED\nresample contacts under P(s),\nrecompute phi\ndestroys: locus-specific structure\npreserves: 1D distance-decay\ncomponent\nCAN KILL THE CLAIM",
