      "x": 525, "y": -422,
      "width": 210, "height": 134,
      "text": "S4 · SEQUENCE-MATCHED (proposed)\nreplace phi with 8 aligned 1D\nsequence covariates (GC, CpG,\ngene density, ...)\ndestroys: all 3D content\nrules out: \"structure is just GC\nand gene density\"",
