    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p1_t",
      "x": -655, "y": -72,
      "width": 510, "height": 124,
      "text": "P1 - SWAP AT INFERENCE (CHEAP, THE GATE)\nfeed REAL-structure-pretrained model S0-S3 at eval only\nmeasures RELIANCE: does behavior depend on phi input?\nRUN. 3 seeds. D_S1 > 1e-12 (kernel floor) + F_S1 non-zero.",
      "originalText": "P1 - SWAP AT INFERENCE (CHEAP, THE GATE)\nfeed REAL-structure-pretrained model S0-S3 at eval only\nmeasures RELIANCE: does behavior depend on phi input?\nRUN. 3 seeds. D_S1 > 1e-12 (kernel floor) + F_S1 non-zero.",
      "fontSize": 14,
