      "width": 510, "height": 124,
      "text": "P2 - SHUFFLE AT PRETRAINING (EXPENSIVE, CONFIRMATORY)\npretrain separate models under S1 and S3, identical seeds/data/compute\nmeasures whether structure HELPED LEARNING\nNOT LAUNCHED: P1 answered the gate; do not launch P2 to re-check a null",
