    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "diagnostics_vs_gate",
      "x": -160, "y": 500,
      "width": 600, "height": 120,
      "text": "The two pre-registered criteria DISAGREED:\nD_S1 > 0 -> PROCEED   versus   D1 < 0.05 -> INERT\nBy the letter of the pre-registered 2x2, that is\nproceed to Phase 5 - and the goalpost was fixed\nbefore the numbers existed. The disagreement is\nitself the informative finding.",
      "originalText": "The two pre-registered criteria DISAGREED:\nD_S1 > 0 -> PROCEED   versus   D1 < 0.05 -> INERT\nBy the letter of the pre-registered 2x2, that is\nproceed to Phase 5 - and the goalpost was fixed\nbefore the numbers existed. The disagreement is\nitself the informative finding.",
